  "title": "Ukraine and Russia: U.S. Threats to Halt Intelligence Sharing Continue Amid Russian Missile Attacks",
  "summary": "Ukrainian president Volodymyr Zelenskyy criticized the lack of early warning from Ukraine’s allies, stating that the attacks on Kyiv caused a significant loss of life, while the U.S. has reiterated its willingness to share intelligence despite concerns about potential withdrawals.",
